---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '중국 생활 — 여행 팁 & 가이드';
const description = '연결 유지, 안전하게, 그리고 여행을 최대한 즐기세요.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="ko">
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-10 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3 leading-tight">중국 생활</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">연결 유지, 안전하게, 그리고 여행을 최대한 즐기세요.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Stats -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-3 mb-12 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-purple-800">3</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-purple-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">인터넷 & 앱</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-cyan-50 border border-cyan-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-cyan-800">3</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">건강 & 의료</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-red-800">3</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">안전 & 비상</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-yellow-800">3</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-yellow-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">문화 & 필수 정보</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-teal-800">1</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-teal-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">숙박</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Category Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-8 mb-16 not-prose">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-purple-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-purple-800">통신 & 인터넷</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-purple-800 opacity-60">3개 문서</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/life/sim-card-guide/" class="block bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-purple-800">📶 인터넷</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">관광객을 위한 최고의 SIM 카드 & eSIM</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">eSIM 제공업체, 공항 SIM 카드, 데이터 요금제 비교.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/ko/life/vpn-guide/" class="block bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-purple-800">🔒 VPN</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국 여행을 위한 최고의 VPN</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">어떤 VPN이 작동하는지, 설정 방법, 도착 전에 준비해야 하는 이유.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/ko/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-purple-800">📱 앱</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국 여행 필수 앱 10선</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">결제, 교통, 번역, 탐색.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-cyan-800">건강 & 의료</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-cyan-800 opacity-60">3개 문서</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/life/seeing-a-doctor/" class="block bg-cyan-50 border border-cyan-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-800">⚕️ 의료</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국에서 병원 방문하기</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">약국, 의원, 병원 — 어떻게 선택할까요.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/ko/life/top-hospitals/" class="block bg-cyan-50 border border-cyan-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-800">🏥 병원</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">국제 진료과가 있는 주요 병원</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">도시별 영어 구사 직원이 있는 최고의 병원.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/ko/life/travel-insurance/" class="block bg-cyan-50 border border-cyan-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-800">🛡️ 보험</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국 여행 보험</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">여행 보험에 대해 알아야 할 사항.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-red-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-800">안전 & 비상</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-red-800 opacity-60">3개 문서</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/life/is-china-safe/" class="block bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">🛡️ 안전</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국 여행은 안전한가요?</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">안전, 범죄, 주의할 점에 대한 솔직한 평가.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/ko/life/common-scams/" class="block bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">⚠️ 사기</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국에서 흔한 사기와 예방 방법</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">가장 흔한 관광객 대상 사기를 식별하고 피하는 방법.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/ko/life/emergency-numbers/" class="block bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">🆘 비상</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">비상 연락처 & 대처 방법</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">필수 연락처와 단계별 비상 대응.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-yellow-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-yellow-800">문화 & 필수 정보</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-yellow-800 opacity-60">4개 문서</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/life/packing-guide/" class="block bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-yellow-800">🧳 짐 싸기</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국에 가져갈 물건</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">계절별 실용적인 짐 싸기 목록.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/ko/life/cultural-taboos/" class="block bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-yellow-800">🙏 에티켓</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국 문화의 에티켓과 금기사항</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">외국인 방문객을 위한 예절 가이드입니다.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/ko/life/chinese-phrases/" class="block bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-yellow-800">🈶 언어</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">관광객을 위한 필수 중국어 회화</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">여행자를 위한 생존 중국어.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-teal-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-teal-800">숙박</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-teal-800 opacity-60">1개 문서</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/life/china-hotels-guide/" class="block bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-teal-800">🏨 호텔</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">외국인을 위한 중국 호텔 예약 방법</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">외국인이 중국에서 호텔 예약하기 — Trip.com, 호텔 요금, 외국인 정책, 체크인, 추천 지역.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

        <!-- Next Step -->
    <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-8 mb-4">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-50 to-blue-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-brand-600 uppercase mb-1">다음 단계</p>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">여행 계획하기</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1 max-w-md">중국 일상 생활 준비 완료. 이제: 비자를 정리하고 교통편을 알아보세요.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 shrink-0">
            <a href="/ko/visa/visa-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              🛂 비자 가이드
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/ko/transport/transport-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              🚗 교통 가이드
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>